//// set: nd-c3 — 多迭代推导式绑定：三重、参数范围、嵌套、依赖范围、空范围、String、修饰里
//// model: C30
model C30
  Real a = time;
  parameter Integer t[:, :, :] = {i + j + k for i in 1:2, j in 1:3, k in 1:2};
end C30;
//// model: C31
model C31
  Real a = time;
  parameter Integer t[2, 3, 2] = {i + j + k for i in 1:2, j in 1:3, k in 1:2};
end C31;
//// model: C32
model C32
  Real a = time;
  constant Integer t[:, :, :] = {i + j + k for i in 1:2, j in 1:3, k in 1:2};
end C32;
//// model: C33
model C33
  Real a = time;
  parameter Real q[2, 3] = {i * 1.5 for i in 1:3, j in 1:2};
end C33;
//// model: C34
model C34
  Real a = time;
  parameter Integer n = 2; parameter Integer s[n, 3] = {i * j for i in 1:3, j in 1:n};
end C34;
//// model: C35
model C35
  Real a = time;
  parameter Integer n = 2; parameter Integer s[:, :] = {i * j * n for i in 1:3, j in 1:2};
end C35;
//// model: C36
model C36
  Real a = time;
  parameter Integer s[2, 3] = {{i + j for i in 1:3} for j in 1:2};
end C36;
//// model: C37
model C37
  Real a = time;
  parameter Integer s[:, :] = {{i + j for i in 1:3} for j in 1:2};
end C37;
//// model: C38
model C38
  Real a = time;
  parameter Integer s[:, :] = {i + j for i in 1:j, j in 1:2};
end C38;
//// model: C39
model C39
  Real a = time;
  parameter Real s[:] = {x * 2 for x in {1.0, 2.5}};
end C39;
//// model: C310
model C310
  Real a = time;
  parameter Integer s[:] = {i for i in {3, 1, 2}};
end C310;
//// model: C311
model C311
  Real a = time;
  parameter Boolean s[:] = {i > 1 for i in 1:3};
end C311;
//// model: C312
model C312
  Real a = time;
  parameter Integer s[:, :] = {i + i for i in 1:3, i in 1:2};
end C312;
//// model: C313
model C313
  Real a = time;
  Real s[:, :] = {i * j * a for i in 1:3, j in 1:2};
end C313;
//// model: C314
model C314
  Real a = time;
  Real s[2, 3, 2] = {i * j * k * a for i in 1:2, j in 1:3, k in 1:2};
end C314;
//// model: C315
model C315
  Real a = time;
  Real s[:, :, :] = {i * j * k * a for i in 1:2, j in 1:3, k in 1:2};
end C315;
//// model: C316
model C316
  Real a = time;
  model A parameter Real p[2, 2]; end A; A q(p = {i + j for i in 1:2, j in 1:2});
end C316;
//// model: C317
model C317
  Real a = time;
  model A parameter Real p[:, :]; end A; A q(p = {i + j for i in 1:2, j in 1:3});
end C317;
//// model: C318
model C318
  Real a = time;
  constant Real c[3] = {1, 2, 3}; constant Real d[:] = {c[i] * 2 for i}; Real y = d[2] * a;
end C318;
//// model: C319
model C319
  Real a = time;
  constant Real c[3] = {1, 2, 3}; constant Real d[:, :] = {c[i] * c[j] for i, j}; Real y = d[2, 3] * a;
end C319;
//// model: C320
model C320
  Real a = time;
  parameter Real p[3] = {1, 2, 3}; parameter Real q[:, :] = {p[i] * j for i, j in 1:2};
end C320;
//// model: C321
model C321
  Real a = time;
  parameter Integer s[0] = {i for i in 1:0};
end C321;
//// model: C322
model C322
  Real a = time;
  parameter Integer s[:] = {i for i in 1:0};
end C322;
//// model: C323
model C323
  Real a = time;
  parameter Integer s[:, :] = {i + j for i in 1:0, j in 1:2};
end C323;
//// model: C324
model C324
  Real a = time;
  parameter String s[2, 2] = {String(i) + String(j) for i in 1:2, j in 1:2};
end C324;
//// model: C325
model C325
  Real a = time;
  parameter Integer s[:] = {i for i in 1:2:5};
end C325;
//// model: C326
model C326
  Real a = time;
  parameter Integer s[:, :] = {i * j for i in 1:2:5, j in {2, 4}};
end C326;
